230
00:12:11,940 --> 00:12:14,609
[yelling] I hate my sister! [pants]

231
00:12:14,693 --> 00:12:16,987
I'm just done with her.
I'm so done with her.

232
00:12:17,070 --> 00:12:19,072
Yeah. I feel you. I hear you.

233
00:12:19,698 --> 00:12:22,242
It's just, I think maybe--
and hear me out--

234
00:12:22,325 --> 00:12:25,078
-your anger's a bit misdirected?
-[Maple] No, it's not!

235
00:12:25,162 --> 00:12:26,872
